  "details": "Description of the bug:\nI like to play macro characters, and there's a problem with mirrors in public rooms\nVery often, mirrors will stop reflecting you (only for you) while you play a large \ncharacters (around 10+ height)\nIt happens very often, but these triggers seems to make it happen very easily:\n- you go to very populated room (12+ people)\n- you change avatar while in a populated room\n- you change room while in a populated room\nOnce the problem triggers, every kind of mirror will stop working.\nPersonal Mirrors, Room mirrors, Face Mirrors, Photo Camera, etc\nOther will still be able to see you on the mirror, but you can't see yourself\nIt can only be fixed by \n- restarting the game\n- changing to a normal sized avatar\n- staying in a room with <5 players\nSteps to reproduce:\nYou can see it happens in this attached video:\nhttps://mega.nz/file/iQQGwLgQ#2KBe3lBlJxdNXIXcCVmmZE9Re1Zfn_7-30Nze61gowQ\n00:00- Private room. Face mirror working. Mirror working\n00:42 - Public room. Face mirror still working\n00:58 - Public room. The problem happens. Face mirror disappears\nAny mirror from this point will not work\nI try different settings with the mirror, but it doesn't help",
